      "imageRatio": "30",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "iei afl3",
      "text": "<h3>Interactive PCs with Intel® 8th Generation Whiskey Lake processor</h3>\r\n<h4>Introducing the AFL3 Series</h4>\r\n<p>IEI offers an impressive portfolio of panel PC solutions - including award winning offerings: medical, transportation and light to heavy industrial models.&nbsp; The AFL3 series of industrial touch screen panel PC falls in the light industrial category and offers a fully interactive experience with rich IO, touch, camera, microphone, and dual integrated speakers. Contact Macnica Americas for more information on this Interactive PC with Intel® 8th Generation Whiskey Lake processor.</p>\r\n",
